US-0201: Save last run + best score locally

As a player, I want my best score saved, so I can beat it later.

AC: After game over, best score updates if higher; persists across refresh.

US-0202: Run history (local)

As a player, I want to see recent runs, so I can track improvement.

AC: Stores last N runs (e.g., 20) with score + timestamp; list renders in Scores page.

US-0203: Clear scores

As a player, I want to reset local scores, so I can start fresh.

AC: “Clear data” button; confirms; wipes best + history.

US-0204: Pause/resume

As a player, I want to pause, so I can step away.

AC: Esc/P pauses; HUD indicates paused; resume continues without state drift.
